# The default font sources are packed byte-for-byte into the shipped QuestPDF.Fonts.Lato archives.
# Never convert their line endings on checkout, otherwise the archive test fails on Windows
# and regenerating the archives there would produce different bytes.
src/dotnet/library/QuestPDF/Resources/LatoFont/** -text
src/dotnet/library/QuestPDF/Resources/QuestPDF.Fonts.Lato.* binary
